@@ -13,9 +13,12 @@
 
 ### Added
 
-- Added deferred strict rpc-ui startup and an isolated Linux native-generation continuation prototype that retains selected physical Session identity through ownership and persistence ([WebUI #32](https://github.com/HowBoring/omp-webui/issues/32)).
+- Added protected durable submission reservation and read-only provenance queries ([WebUI #36](https://github.com/HowBoring/omp-webui/issues/36)).
+
 - Added exact native live-message/entry observation settlement, opt-in immutable-cut live handoff and scoped bounded source changes ([WebUI #35](https://github.com/HowBoring/omp-webui/issues/35)).
 
+- Added deferred strict rpc-ui startup and an isolated Linux native-generation continuation prototype that retains selected physical Session identity through ownership and persistence ([WebUI #32](https://github.com/HowBoring/omp-webui/issues/32)).
+
 - Added atomic retained-tree, active-chain and running-message observations with bounded expiring pages and native image content reads ([WebUI #34](https://github.com/HowBoring/omp-webui/issues/34)).
 
 - Added a diagnostic-only `--rpc-preflight` compatibility startup path that reports public build/schema identity before Session or user configuration initialization ([WebUI #30](https://github.com/HowBoring/omp-webui/issues/30)).
